From 2db095c97f7484d8e2625093634146354c4df499 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:59:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Pad: the line skin, the only button set, with a floating left
 stick and a button editor (0110)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Black-and-white line art with gold swooshes (pad_line_*.png, 512x512), the
only button set: 0107 (gunmetal) and 0109 (the skin switch) are dropped,
and there is no DM_PAD_SKIN setting or a way back to the vector buttons.
The left stick is floating and hidden: a touch anywhere in the left half
(but a visible button) makes it appear where it lands and follow the
finger; it hides on release. X, ZR, R, L3, R3 and the whole D-pad are
hidden and cannot be pressed. + / - / gear use the line icons (+ / - are
circles); ZL is the ground-pound icon, L the camera icon, Y the attack
icon, A and B their letters. Two extra buttons: jump (B) left of the
diamond and photo (D-pad down) left of jump. The in-game menu gains
"按键设置" (button settings): a size slider (0.7-1.4) and dragging the
icons to move them, saved in NSUserDefaults (DmPadLineLayout) so the
layout survives a restart. The left stick is the upstream default, drawn
in vector (two CAShapeLayers, no image): a ring filled white at 0.06 and a
knob at 0.14 (0.45 while held), both stroked white at 0.38. Also folds in
0108 (dropped): the set() aspect-store NOP stays disabled (iOS code signing
kills the app, log-14) and Sources/PadIcons is bundled as a resource of
the game's framework bundle.
